doc Lets filesystem and rt/fs be used together, frees the word in, and respells while and +=.
needs resolve filesystem rt std stdx
resolve
  // filesystem's names get their own prefix
  rename prefix 'fs_' in filesystem to 'filesys_'
  rename name 'FS_LIMIT' in filesystem/files to 'FILESYS_LIMIT'
  rename keyword 'in' in stdx to 'within'
  // for and for-in expand into while: their templates follow the rename
  rename keyword 'while' in std/while to 'loop'
  rename symbol '+=' in stdx/add_assign to '+:='
end
